{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 9, 19]], "date-time": "2026-09-19T11:59:08Z", "timestamp": 1789819148304, "version": "4.0.1"}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "S. Karger AG", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[2008, 11, 28]], "date-time": "2008-11-28T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1227830400000}, "content-version": "vor", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://karger.com/pages/terms-and-conditions"}, {"start": {"date-parts": [[2008, 11, 28]], "date-time": "2008-11-28T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1227830400000}, "content-version": "tdm", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://karger.com/pages/terms-and-conditions"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "short-container-title": ["Nephron"], "abstract": "<jats:p>A formula has been developed to predict creatinine clearance (C&lt;sub&gt;cr&lt;/sub&gt;) from serum creatinine (S&lt;sub&gt;cr&lt;/sub&gt;) in adult males: Ccr = (140 \u2013 age) (wt kg)/72 \u00d7 S&lt;sub&gt;cr&lt;/sub&gt;(mg/100ml) (15% less in females). Derivation included the relationship found between age and 24-hour creatinine excretion/kg in 249 patients aged 18\u201392. Values for C&lt;sub&gt;cr&lt;/sub&gt; were predicted by this formula and four other methods and the results compared with the means of two 24-hour C&lt;sub&gt;cr\u2019s&lt;/sub&gt; measured in 236 patients. The above formula gave a correlation coefficient between predicted and mean measured Ccr\u00b7s of 0.83; on average, the difference between predicted and mean measured values was no greater than that between paired clearances. Factors for age and body weight must be included for reasonable prediction.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.1159/000180580", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2008, 11, 29]], "date-time": "2008-11-29T09:20:02Z", "timestamp": 1227950402000}, "page": "31-41", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 11961, "title": ["Prediction of Creatinine Clearance from Serum Creatinine"], "prefix": "10.1159", "author": [{"given": "Donald W.", "family": "Cockcroft", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Henry", "family": "Gault", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "127", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2008, 11, 28]]}, "container-title": ["Nephron"], "original-title": [], "language": "en", "link": [{"URL": "https://karger.com/article-pdf/doi/10.1159/000180580", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 5, 1]], "date-time": "2026-05-01T15:10:43Z", "timestamp": 1777648243000}, "score": 1, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://karger.com/article/doi/10.1159/000180580"}}, "subtitle": [], "short-title": [], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2008, 11, 28]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1159/000180580", "archive": ["Portico"], "relation": {}, "ISSN": ["1660-8151", "2235-3186"], "issn-type": [{"value": "1660-8151", "type": "print"}, {"value": "2235-3186", "type": "electronic"}], "subject": [], "published": {"date-parts": [[2008, 11, 28]]}}}